// Granted by Heroes/Brute's JuggernautKnockbackSkillAction - while present, JuggernautSkillData's own
// ResolveKnockbackMultiplier scales BOTH KnockbackForce and KnockbackUpwardForce by (1 + ForceBonus)
// when a discharge fires - a stronger push and a higher pop, not a bigger radius (KnockbackRadius is
// untouched by this).
//
// Begin-only, deliberately not paired with End - same reasoning as every other "configures what the
// skill does" upgrade this session: re-granting fresh (idempotent) every activation and never
// removing it means it's simply always there once picked, with nothing to race against.
component JuggernautKnockbackUpgrade
{
    FP ForceBonus;
}
